REPORT ZGTMMR4915 NO STANDARD PAGE HEADING MESSAGE-ID ZGTMM01.


INCLUDE ZGTMMR4915TOP.
INCLUDE ZGTMMR4915C01.
INCLUDE ZGTMMR4915O01.
INCLUDE ZGTMMR4915I01.
INCLUDE ZGTMMR4915F01.


*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* INITIALIZATION
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
INITIALIZATION.
  PERFORM SET_INIT.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* AT SELECTION-SCREEN OUTPUT
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN OUTPUT.
  PERFORM MODIFY_SCREEN.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* AT SELECTION-SCREEN
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN.
* PERFORM CHECK_AUTH.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON VALUE-REQUEST FOR P_IFSYT.
  PERFORM F4_IFSYT USING 'P_IFSYT'.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* START-OF-SELECTION
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
START-OF-SELECTION.
  PERFORM CHECK_COND.
  PERFORM GET_DATA.

  CHECK GV_CNT IS NOT INITIAL.

  IF P_BAT = GC_X.
    PERFORM SEND_DATA USING ' '.
  ELSE.
    CALL SCREEN 100.
  ENDIF.
